ut still physiognomically intact and ideal for gathering samples. (#133, D, very rare, no sample)\n\n'Giant Verminous': These mutations of various common deciduous trees are usually quite high. Leaves and branches are generally bound upwards (periwinkle, non-weeping) which makes them nearly impossible to gather. (...) some specimens grow subterranean (broad crown, tendriled treetop) and should be easier to reach. Typical locations are dry and secure from animals. (#137, A, very rare, no sample)","unique_id":6296}],"revision":"201189f871d23597b82caf88fd611454a2ddefb8","schema":"OTERYN_NATIVE_CONTAINER_REWARD/v1","source_sha256":"b073d546930a60adf511677f932e6e0d37df3a230313dc85c4b9253742325757"},"placements":[{"appearance_tibia_id":2469,"reward":{"items":[{"count":1,"item":{"family":"Item","key":"oteryn:item.tibia.i11699","revision":"definition-r1"}}],"written_text":{"item":{"family":"Item","key":"oteryn:item.tibia.i11699","revision":"definition-r1"},"text_ref":{"length":998,"placeholders":[],"sha256":"ab5fcc7f25cc5e5039b1cdd1cf3dca12fc6e55bcfb9fa43ac0c6d79fc8e06cc4"}}},"source_binding":{"legacy_unique_ids":[{"server":"canary","unique_id":6296},{"server":"crystalserver","unique_id":6296}],"project_position":{"x":33004,"y":31530,"z":10}}}],"provenance":{"pilot_key":"canary:reward-claim/quest/u8_6/an_interest_in_botany/botany_almanach","pilot_revision":"canary-04b83b51+crystalserver-9f5a72c6"},"quest":{"family":"Quest","key":"canary:quest/an_interest_in_botany_quest","revision":"canary-04b83b51+crystalserver-9f5a72c6"},"readiness":"waiting_implementation","source_variant":{"achievement_grants":[],"authoring_dispositions":[{"closed_contract_refs":["Quest authoring format §3 reward.written_text","WRITE-0"],"data_format":"COVERED","data_status":"AUTHORED","feature":"written_text","reasons":[],"ruling_id":5933264015}],"charge_dispositions":[],"item_bindings":[{"argument":{"kind":"COUNT_OR_SUBTYPE_RETAINED","raw_count_argument":1,"source_charges":null,"source_quantity":null}